# A thousand and eighty-three names written by ICU 79.1 (CLDR 49), the
# reference this package is held to: each line one of the commands of a
# one-off oracle program over `uldnames.h`, which is not in the tree, and
# what ICU answered, separated by tabs. `lang`, `script`, `region` and
# `variant` are a locale written in and a code, `short` after it where ICU
# was asked for its short names; `key` a locale and a key, `value` a locale,
# a key and a value, in BCP 47's names, ICU asked by its long names and by
# BCP 47's and its answer kept where either names it; `locale` a locale
# written in, a tag, and `std` or `dialect`. A code ICU names in no language
# is answered by the code itself. Drawn at random (seed 23) on 2026-11-24
# over fifty locales written in that both CLDR 49 and ICU carry, twenty of
# them chosen and thirty drawn; left out, 17 whole locales ICU wrote with a
# keyword as `key=value`, its lookup by its own long key missing a name its
# data has under BCP 47's (`hours=h23` for `hc`), which this package names.
# Only a test build reads the cases.

# The cases.
